msgid "Xorro Direct Wallet Payments for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Xorro Portafoglio diretto Pagamenti per WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://github.com/x-o-r-r-o/xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce"
